A '''Rainbow Feather''' is an {{Epic}} [[Pet]] Consumable.

== Obtaining ==
A '''Rainbow Feather''' has a guaranteed chance to drop when [[Hunting]] a {{Sparkling}} {{mt|Critter}} in the {{Zone|Critter Safari}}. The {{Attr|Splendor}} attribute grants a {{Green|+2}}-{{Green|25%}} chance to drop a bonus '''Rainbow Feather''' when enabled.

== Usage ==
A '''Rainbow Feather''' can be used by right-clicking on a summoned [[Pet]] to grant it {{Green|+1}} level. The item is consumed on use.

