== Trivia ==
* This item may have been inspired by the ''[[W:Pokémon|Pokémon]]'' item of the [[Bulb:Rainbow Feather|same name]], formerly known as the Rainbow Wing.
** '''Rainbow Feather''' in SkyBlock also shares its functionality with the [[Bulb:Rare Candy|Rare Candy]] from the games as well.
*While this item appeared on the [[Alpha Hypixel Network]], it was a consumable item that granted Pets {{stat|mf|1}} up to {{green|5 times}}.

